Hi Elikana,

Based on your code, it would seem the coordinates for your individuals 
are saved in FRAcoordinates. Hence try:

FRA.lxy <- xyt.lxy(xy=FRAcoordinates, dt=FRA.localtime, 
id="FRA",proj4string=CRS("+proj=utm +south +zone=36 +ellps=WGS84"))

If you still get the error message, email me back and I'll help you 
diagnose the error.

Cheers,

Andy




